        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Hyper-Scape-combat.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/hyper-scape\">Hyper Scape</a> feels like something that happened ages ago, but Ubisoft's failed battle royale game <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/ubisofts-beleaguered-battle-royale-game-hyper-scape-is-shutting-down-in-april\">was shut down in April 2022</a> after halting its content updates a year before that. The game itself <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/hyper-scape-review-a-battle-royale-as-smart-as-it-is-generic\">wasn't anything special</a>, yet no small amount of FPS veterans praised its core traversal and movement mechanics. This is why a passionate fan is attempting to bring it back from the live-service graveyard.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/ubisoft-battle-royale-shooter-hyper-scape-gets-fan-revival-project\">Read more</a></p>",
